1
00:02:31,075 --> 00:02:34,260
How long are you going to sleep?
It's already well past morning.

2
00:02:36,385 --> 00:02:38,176
I'm still sleepy.

3
00:02:38,655 --> 00:02:41,094
If you don't get up soon,
you'll be late for school.

4
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:43,475
Pi the sparrow is even
trying to wake you up.

5
00:02:43,499 --> 00:02:45,019
Come on, up you get. Here.

6
00:02:47,344 --> 00:02:48,344
I'm so sleepy...

7
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:55,260
It's too bright.

8
00:02:55,844 --> 00:02:57,940
What are you talking about?
Hurry and get up.

9
00:03:00,394 --> 00:03:01,394


10
00:03:02,686 --> 00:03:05,237
Mokku, what's the problem?

11
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:09,240
First of all, the hem on this
nightshirt is way too long.

12
00:03:09,659 --> 00:03:13,409
I told you I didn't want to wear
your old bed clothes, Grandpa!

13
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:15,087
Huh?

14
00:03:20,100 --> 00:03:22,702
Good grief, what a handful you are.

15
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:27,130
Come on now... Huh?

16
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:29,700
Shut up!

17
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:33,278
Chirp, chirp, chirp, chirp!
You're so noisy!

18
00:03:33,429 --> 00:03:34,710
I'll turn you into roasted bird!

19
00:03:36,945 --> 00:03:38,240
Oh crap, it's getting away!

20
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,520
You shouldn't say things like that, Mokku.

21
00:03:40,694 --> 00:03:43,340
Pi the sparrow is your friend, isn't he?

22
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:44,920
Hey, Grandpa.

23
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,180
What's underneath this snow?

24
00:03:50,024 --> 00:03:51,024
The earth.

25
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:52,300
The earth?

26
00:03:52,590 --> 00:03:54,540
Yes. Spring will be here soon.

27
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:59,780
When it comes, this snow will melt.
And the brown earth will appear.

28
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:05,422
That soil grows green grass and
makes all kinds of flowers bloom...

29
00:04:05,447 --> 00:04:07,494
...delighting human eyes.

30
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:11,148
And beneath that soil,

31
00:04:11,172 --> 00:04:14,900
all sorts of animals are sleeping,
waiting for spring to arrive.

32
00:04:15,620 --> 00:04:21,056
When the snow melts, they wake up
and jump out into the sun.

33
00:05:52,115 --> 00:05:53,296
But listen, my little Mokku...

34
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:56,580
The riverbanks are very dangerous
during the spring thaw.

35
00:05:57,612 --> 00:05:58,881
Last year around this exact time...

36
00:05:58,906 --> 00:06:01,843
...a mischievous little boy was
playing down by the riverbank...

37
00:06:10,610 --> 00:06:13,760
Hey! Wait! Wait!

38
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,380
Hey! Wait! Wait!

39
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,605
Help!

40
00:06:26,630 --> 00:06:28,920
Help me! Help me!

41
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:31,780
Help me! Help!

42
00:06:40,422 --> 00:06:41,452
Understand?

43
00:06:42,781 --> 00:06:46,211
Never go near the riverbank, Mokku.

44
00:06:49,845 --> 00:06:52,964
Good, you understand. Good boy.

45
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:58,950
You're a good boy, Mokku. There, there.

46
00:06:59,515 --> 00:07:03,364
Tch, Mokku's acting like a
spoiled brat again. Ugh!

47
00:07:03,540 --> 00:07:06,405
Now, brush your teeth and wash your face.

48
00:07:06,429 --> 00:07:08,285
Breakfast is ready.

49
00:07:09,035 --> 00:07:09,720
Yes!

50
00:07:09,745 --> 00:07:11,060
Oh, what a good boy.

51
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:13,105
Argh! Honestly!

52
00:07:13,181 --> 00:07:15,375
Damn it! That Mokku!

53
00:07:16,300 --> 00:07:17,909
Oh! Redbeard!

54
00:07:18,045 --> 00:07:19,647
Oh dear, I completely forgot.

55
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,520
You haven't had your
breakfast yet, have you?

56
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:29,018
There, there, I'm sorry.
You must be hungry.

57
00:07:29,495 --> 00:07:31,240
Come on, up you go.
Come on now.

58
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:35,680
I'm off!

59
00:07:36,530 --> 00:07:38,060
Here, Mokku, your lunch!

60
00:07:38,305 --> 00:07:40,740
Delicious ham and cheese sandwiches.

61
00:07:41,691 --> 00:07:42,691
What?

62
00:07:42,985 --> 00:07:44,694
Oh, sandwiches!

63
00:07:45,226 --> 00:07:46,360
Thank you, Grandpa.

64
00:07:46,725 --> 00:07:49,573
Listen to your teacher
and study hard, okay?

65
00:07:51,245 --> 00:07:52,669
Yes! I'm off!

66
00:07:53,135 --> 00:07:55,026
Careful, don't rush or you'll trip again.

67
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:57,520
Damn it, all he does is dote on Mokku.

68
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:07,380
Grandpa said it's a delicious
ham and cheese sandwich, but...

69
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,480
I can't taste anything I eat.

70
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:14,320
I wonder what "delicious" tastes like.

71
00:08:16,395 --> 00:08:18,820
I wish I could become human right now.

72
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,225
- That's impossible.
- Huh?

73
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:23,707
Ah! The Meddling Cricket!
You're heavy! Get off me!

74
00:08:25,350 --> 00:08:28,660
There's no way I'm heavy.
I'm a cricket ghost, after all.

75
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:32,640
Ghosts aren't supposed to come out in
broad daylight! Just disappear already!

76
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:38,380
Can't do that. The Oak Tree Fairy
asked me to keep an eye on you.

77
00:08:39,305 --> 00:08:41,724
I told you, I don't need
a watchdog anymore!

78
00:08:41,990 --> 00:08:43,799
I'm definitely going to be a good boy!

79
00:08:43,985 --> 00:08:45,577
Oh really? I wonder if you can.

80
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:46,875
Isn't that a bit of a stretch?

81
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:48,020
Shut up!

82
00:08:48,495 --> 00:08:50,815
I have to, or I'll never become human!

83
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,640
Wait up, Mokku!

84
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,755
I don't know about that...

85
00:08:53,780 --> 00:08:56,067
You're so gullible, you'll
just get tricked in no—

86
00:08:56,091 --> 00:08:57,185
- Shut up!
- Its true!

87
00:08:57,820 --> 00:08:58,820
Mind your own business!

88
00:09:02,359 --> 00:09:03,249
Good grief.

89
00:09:03,274 --> 00:09:05,646
I sure took on a handful to look after.

90
00:09:05,670 --> 00:09:07,583
I dread what lies ahead.

91
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:11,173
Damn it, damn it, damn it! That Mokku...

92
00:09:11,390 --> 00:09:13,480
I've gotta get rid of him somehow.

93
00:09:13,710 --> 00:09:17,243
No, I'll destroy him so he never
shows his face to the old man again.

94
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:19,412
Isn't there a good plan?

95
00:09:19,436 --> 00:09:23,068
Mokku must be eating his
lunch right about now.

96
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:25,160
Mokku again?!

97
00:09:25,385 --> 00:09:28,058
What should I make for his lunch tomorrow?

98
00:09:28,185 --> 00:09:31,620
I know, I'll make him a corned
beef sandwich tomorrow.

99
00:09:31,769 --> 00:09:33,154
Gaaah, damn it!

100
00:09:33,178 --> 00:09:35,365
Corned beef for a wooden puppet like that?!

101
00:09:35,389 --> 00:09:37,630
Giving something so delicious to him...
Curse him, curse him, curse him!

102
00:09:38,319 --> 00:09:43,310
Speaking of corned beef, I love it too,
but wasn't it Kenken the fox who...

103
00:09:43,334 --> 00:09:46,032
Ah, that's it! Here it is!

104
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,160
Goodbye!

105
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,155
See ya!

106
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:53,955
See you tomorrow!

107
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:54,980
Bye-bye!

108
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:14,640
Huh?

109
00:10:16,733 --> 00:10:17,779
Look at this...

110
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:23,676
Grandpa, why are you crying?
Did I do something bad again?

111
00:10:23,989 --> 00:10:25,563
No, Mokku.

112
00:10:25,587 --> 00:10:31,540
You've learned to write so wonderfully.
Even though you're a wooden puppet.

113
00:10:34,355 --> 00:10:38,640
I'm just happy. So happy that
snot's coming out of my eyes.

114
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:44,380
Humans are funny. Snot comes out
of your eyes when you're happy?

115
00:10:44,795 --> 00:10:47,820
That's right. When we're very happy.

116
00:10:52,334 --> 00:10:54,400
That brat, just you wait.

117
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:56,820
Go enjoy being pampered while you can.

118
00:10:56,999 --> 00:10:58,620
Just wait till tomorrow.

119
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,494
What?

120
00:11:01,519 --> 00:11:03,295
You're saying we can get a meal?!

121
00:11:03,327 --> 00:11:04,366
Is that true?

122
00:11:04,435 --> 00:11:06,775
Food? Um... food?

123
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:09,379
Yay! We can eat food! I wonder why?

124
00:11:09,432 --> 00:11:10,350
That's right.

125
00:11:10,375 --> 00:11:12,280
This is guaranteed to be true.

126
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:13,808
You're not lying to me, are you?

127
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:15,080
Is that a lie?

128
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,520
As if I'd lie! Kenken,
what are you talking about?

129
00:11:16,545 --> 00:11:18,292
I-I can't breathe! Let go of me, Boss!

130
00:11:18,317 --> 00:11:20,610
Where was that food?!

131
00:11:21,727 --> 00:11:26,844
Thanks to all this snow, we haven't had
any real food for four or five days.

132
00:11:26,868 --> 00:11:28,130
I wonder why?

133
00:11:28,295 --> 00:11:32,329
Right now, Mokku the puppet is coming
this way with a sandwich, Boss.

134
00:11:32,425 --> 00:11:35,316
A sandwich? That's just bread!

135
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:36,880
It's bread, sure, but...

136
00:11:37,801 --> 00:11:42,711
Inside, there's heaps of corned beef,
your favorite, Boss...

137
00:11:42,784 --> 00:11:44,460
Corned beef, you say?!

138
00:11:44,461 --> 00:11:47,890
You're killing me. And there's
probably cheese and ham, ham...

139
00:11:47,914 --> 00:11:50,955
Cheese? And ham too? Oh, God!

140
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:53,229
All my favorites!

141
00:11:53,310 --> 00:11:57,387
I'd completely forgotten what
cheese smells like. Wonder why?

142
00:11:57,505 --> 00:12:01,334
Oh, little puppet, little
puppet, hurry on over!

143
00:12:01,555 --> 00:12:05,180
Idiot! That puppet isn't bringing it to us!

144
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:07,760
Huh? Then how're we gonna get the sandwich?

145
00:12:08,020 --> 00:12:11,120
You idiot! That's what we
have to figure out! Dimwit!

146
00:12:11,980 --> 00:12:15,280
Boss is always grabbing me
by the collar. Wonder why?

147
00:12:15,550 --> 00:12:17,740
Well, I've got a great idea.

148
00:12:17,900 --> 00:12:18,900
What?

149
00:12:19,209 --> 00:12:21,080
Lend me your ear...

150
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:26,280
I see. Take him down by the brook and...

151
00:12:31,749 --> 00:12:35,320
We lure Mokku down by the
stream and snatch his sandwich.

152
00:12:35,425 --> 00:12:37,840
And then toss him right into the river...

153
00:12:37,864 --> 00:12:39,880
Wait, what? You mean shove him in?

154
00:12:39,881 --> 00:12:41,495
If you do that...

155
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:45,720
...he'll fall right into that raging
waterfall basin and die. I wonder why.

156
00:12:46,305 --> 00:12:47,305
Hmm, I see.

157
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:53,024
Still, do we really have to kill
him just to get a sandwich?

158
00:12:53,689 --> 00:12:58,460
Come on, he's just a puppet!
He's only falling into the river.

159
00:12:58,497 --> 00:13:00,880
Oh, how terrifying! I wonder why.

160
00:13:01,155 --> 00:13:02,685
We'd better get rid of him.

161
00:13:02,857 --> 00:13:04,916
Even though Mokku is just
a puppet made of wood,

162
00:13:04,941 --> 00:13:09,494
he walks and talks like a human,
and he's even learned to write!

163
00:13:10,202 --> 00:13:15,442
That's why the old man dotes on him,
and taking advantage of that,

164
00:13:15,466 --> 00:13:19,140
he bullies me from morning
till night for no reason at all!

165
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:22,800
Making my little bro
Redbeard suffer like that...

166
00:13:22,824 --> 00:13:25,440
All right, I'll chop Mokku in half
and make him Half-a-Mokku!

167
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:26,718
Leave it to me!

168
00:13:26,938 --> 00:13:29,894
Aha, here he comes, here he comes!

169
00:13:29,940 --> 00:13:30,848
All right, hide!

170
00:13:30,873 --> 00:13:34,181
Oh, he really came.
I wonder why! Oh my, oh my.

171
00:13:40,574 --> 00:13:41,840
Here he comes! Let's move!

172
00:13:42,152 --> 00:13:43,593
Oh, that smell!

173
00:13:43,617 --> 00:13:47,180
Ah, I remember now. It's the smell
of cheese. Man, that takes me back.

174
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:51,975
Hey, Mokku.

175
00:13:52,023 --> 00:13:54,259
Oh, Redbeard. What are you doing here?

176
00:13:54,415 --> 00:13:57,710
Listen, Kenken and Hanaguro asked if
you want to go see something cool.

177
00:13:57,734 --> 00:13:59,030
Wanna come with?

178
00:13:59,380 --> 00:14:01,542
No way. I have to go to school.

179
00:14:02,107 --> 00:14:04,154
Don't be like that, just come along.

180
00:14:04,187 --> 00:14:05,211
Hey, wait...

181
00:14:05,235 --> 00:14:08,851
Listen, right nearby, moles are
popping out of the dirt and wrestling!

182
00:14:08,875 --> 00:14:10,980
It's so cool, mole wrestling!

183
00:14:11,155 --> 00:14:13,167
Whoa, moles are wrestling?

184
00:14:13,220 --> 00:14:14,220
Really and truly!

185
00:14:14,665 --> 00:14:17,007
Hey, Mokku, you can't dawdle!

186
00:14:17,210 --> 00:14:19,550
Mokku, you have to go straight to school!

187
00:14:19,660 --> 00:14:20,976
Shut up, you busybody!

188
00:14:21,352 --> 00:14:22,700
I'm just taking a quick look.

189
00:14:23,140 --> 00:14:24,140
No, no!

190
00:14:24,180 --> 00:14:25,965
What's the harm in just a second?

191
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:26,728
No!

192
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:29,539
Hey, Mokku, who are you
talking to all by yourself?

193
00:14:29,563 --> 00:14:31,085
You're creeping me out.

194
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:33,808
Oh, nothing. Come on, let's go, let's go!

195
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:38,180
Oh, that Mokku...

196
00:14:38,297 --> 00:14:40,615
Come on, hurry! Hurry!

197
00:14:41,380 --> 00:14:43,080
You finally went and said it.

198
00:14:43,335 --> 00:14:44,335
Don't blame me!

199
00:14:47,879 --> 00:14:49,544
Where are they? These moles.

200
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:51,295
Right over here.

201
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,951
You have to lean way
out or the water weeds...

202
00:14:52,976 --> 00:14:54,696
...get in the way and you can't see them.

203
00:14:54,969 --> 00:14:56,817
Go ahead and look.

204
00:14:58,422 --> 00:14:59,436
Hold on, you.

205
00:15:00,399 --> 00:15:04,867
The mole just woke from hibernation
and is starving. It'll steal your lunch.

206
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:07,160
Give it to me, I'll hold onto it.

207
00:15:08,339 --> 00:15:09,580
Thanks. Take care of it.

208
00:15:10,379 --> 00:15:11,559
I can't see anything.

209
00:15:11,740 --> 00:15:13,118
Lean out further.

210
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:15,420
It's too dark, I can't see a thing.

211
00:15:15,775 --> 00:15:18,860
You won't see inside that hole
unless you lean out further.

212
00:15:19,195 --> 00:15:22,286
- There's no hole!
- Stick your head in deeper!

213
00:15:29,089 --> 00:15:30,760
Help me, you dummy!

214
00:15:30,761 --> 00:15:34,620
No way! Who would ever
save you? Just go sink!

215
00:15:34,797 --> 00:15:36,109
Help me!

216
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:42,086
Now the old man will only love me!

217
00:15:43,735 --> 00:15:45,042
Man, food this delicious is irresistible!

218
00:15:45,067 --> 00:15:46,330
 It's too good!

219
00:15:46,355 --> 00:15:48,880
No way I'd waste this on a puppet!

220
00:15:52,459 --> 00:15:54,639
Help! Somebody help me!

221
00:15:56,279 --> 00:15:58,660
Mokku! Hey! Mokku!

222
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,160
Help!

223
00:16:00,629 --> 00:16:02,880
Mokku! Mokku, hang on!

224
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:07,800
See, what did I tell you?!

225
00:16:08,045 --> 00:16:09,563
Ah! Mokku!

226
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:13,226
Help me, Grandpa!

227
00:16:13,459 --> 00:16:16,200
Yeah, I'm sure I heard Mokku's voice.

228
00:16:17,345 --> 00:16:19,534
No, no, Mokku is at school.

229
00:16:20,237 --> 00:16:22,360
There's no way I could hear him.

230
00:16:32,099 --> 00:16:33,680
I don't want to die!

231
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:37,049
Somebody help me!

232
00:16:43,519 --> 00:16:45,046
Mokku!

233
00:16:45,175 --> 00:16:46,589
Mokku!

234
00:16:58,259 --> 00:16:59,259
Oh, Mokku!

235
00:17:00,929 --> 00:17:04,560
Mokku, hang in there! You're a man,
aren't you? Muster up all your strength!

236
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:07,500
Oh, Mokku!

237
00:17:08,300 --> 00:17:09,300
Keep fighting!

238
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,920
Mokku!

239
00:17:13,939 --> 00:17:15,319
Hang in there, Mokku!

240
00:17:15,584 --> 00:17:17,099
Ah, just a little! Keep at it!

241
00:17:23,669 --> 00:17:25,819
Ah! It's the Oak Tree Fairy!

242
00:17:26,424 --> 00:17:28,580
Hold on, Mokku!

243
00:17:28,919 --> 00:17:30,800
Come on, be brave!

244
00:17:31,444 --> 00:17:33,780
If you give up now, you'll
never become human!

245
00:17:34,299 --> 00:17:36,740
Come on, pull yourself
together and climb up!

246
00:17:37,074 --> 00:17:38,500
Don't give up, Mokku!

247
00:17:38,825 --> 00:17:39,940
That's it, Mokku!

248
00:17:39,964 --> 00:17:41,575
Just a little more!
Keep going!

249
00:17:47,199 --> 00:17:48,830
You did it!

250
00:17:56,894 --> 00:17:58,020
Mokku,

251
00:17:58,388 --> 00:18:00,057
do you understand now?

252
00:18:00,667 --> 00:18:03,580
This is divine punishment for
not listening to your grandfather.

253
00:18:04,908 --> 00:18:09,020
You must never make the same mistake again.

254
00:18:10,409 --> 00:18:13,520
You mustn't bring grief
to your grandfather.

255
00:18:25,979 --> 00:18:27,558
Grandpa!

256
00:18:28,558 --> 00:18:30,740
That was definitely Mokku's voice!

257
00:18:31,139 --> 00:18:33,120
And it sounded serious.

258
00:18:33,910 --> 00:18:34,940
Mokku couldn't have...

259
00:18:39,979 --> 00:18:40,619
No...

260
00:18:42,496 --> 00:18:47,000
...panicking now won't help.
Mokku isn't even here...

261
00:18:50,605 --> 00:18:52,089
Mokku!

262
00:18:52,988 --> 00:18:54,668
Oh, Mokku!

263
00:18:59,299 --> 00:19:00,346
Mokku!

264
00:19:00,730 --> 00:19:01,739
What happened?

265
00:19:02,979 --> 00:19:04,050
You're burning up!

266
00:19:04,261 --> 00:19:06,215
Hang in there, Mokku!

267
00:19:07,384 --> 00:19:09,594
Look at poor me, falling
into the river like this!

268
00:19:10,089 --> 00:19:11,487
So you fell into the river?

269
00:19:11,636 --> 00:19:15,299
I told you so many times
never to go near the river!

270
00:19:17,902 --> 00:19:19,214
Grandpa...

271
00:19:19,371 --> 00:19:21,136
 I'm sorry.

272
00:19:23,614 --> 00:19:27,339
I did what Grandpa told me not to do.

273
00:19:27,644 --> 00:19:28,761
That's why...

274
00:19:28,785 --> 00:19:30,560
...that's why I'm being punished.

275
00:19:31,219 --> 00:19:36,880
Grandpa, I'm sorry. I'll never be
bad again. I'll be a good boy.

276
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:40,089
It's all right. It's all right, Mokku.

277
00:19:40,113 --> 00:19:44,029
As long as you realize what you did was
wrong, that's all that matters, Mokku...

278
00:19:51,989 --> 00:19:53,320
Are you in pain?

279
00:19:55,024 --> 00:19:57,416
I hope you get better soon.

280
00:20:06,054 --> 00:20:10,183
I'll stay right by your side
and fix you up, I promise.

281
00:20:11,179 --> 00:20:12,726
Please get well.

282
00:20:13,157 --> 00:20:16,520
You're my precious treasure.

283
00:20:17,399 --> 00:20:18,648
Damn it! What's he babbling about?!

284
00:20:18,672 --> 00:20:20,367
I went through all that
trouble to finish him off!

285
00:20:20,391 --> 00:20:22,200
I won't just stand by and let him recover!

286
00:20:27,582 --> 00:20:32,086
God, please, save Mokku's life.

287
00:20:32,110 --> 00:20:37,918
In exchange for the little time I
have left, please spare Mokku...

288
00:20:38,839 --> 00:20:44,920
I beg of you, God.
Please, save Mokku's life.

289
00:20:45,749 --> 00:20:49,084
Heh, you've gotta be kidding. If he
comes back to life, I'm in trouble.

290
00:20:49,514 --> 00:20:50,562
That's it.

291
00:20:51,446 --> 00:20:54,360
The moment the old man lets his
guard down, I'll chew Mokku to pieces.

292
00:20:54,940 --> 00:20:57,563
All right, time to sharpen my fangs.

293
00:20:58,175 --> 00:20:59,180
That's it!

294
00:20:59,204 --> 00:21:01,664
If I dig through the snow on the
mountain behind the house,

295
00:21:01,805 --> 00:21:04,627
I might find some herbs
to bring down his fever.

296
00:21:06,879 --> 00:21:09,560
Mokku, I'll be right back.

297
00:21:16,272 --> 00:21:17,808
Now's my chance!

298
00:21:30,301 --> 00:21:34,771
Once he's gone, ripping his
throat out will be a piece of cake.

299
00:21:35,689 --> 00:21:36,940
Oh no!

300
00:21:38,949 --> 00:21:40,662
Damn it! Stop it!

301
00:21:41,549 --> 00:21:45,280
Huh? S-Someone pulled my whiskers. Huh?

302
00:21:45,719 --> 00:21:47,597
He can't see me!

303
00:21:47,621 --> 00:21:48,612
Serves you right!

304
00:21:48,637 --> 00:21:51,076
All right, I won't let go of these
whiskers even if it kills me!

305
00:21:51,819 --> 00:21:54,330
Wh-Who is it?! Who's pulling my whiskers?!

306
00:21:55,569 --> 00:21:57,172
They got pulled right out!

307
00:21:58,639 --> 00:22:00,493
Who needs a head like this?!

308
00:22:02,749 --> 00:22:05,450
My pr-precious... my precious
teeth are completely ruined!

309
00:22:05,779 --> 00:22:07,801
Why did something like this come flying in?

310
00:22:08,229 --> 00:22:13,720
All right, perfect. I'll smash
his face in with this hammer!

311
00:22:15,264 --> 00:22:18,525
Ow! My hand went numb!

312
00:22:19,780 --> 00:22:21,014
Serves you right!

313
00:22:21,409 --> 00:22:24,020
Damn it! Someone's getting in my way!

314
00:22:24,158 --> 00:22:25,785
All right, take this!

315
00:22:33,979 --> 00:22:35,700
All right, just a little more!

316
00:22:39,519 --> 00:22:41,816
I did it! Banzai!

317
00:22:43,665 --> 00:22:44,884
Serves you right!

318
00:22:45,239 --> 00:22:47,900
I knew it, if I don't use my own
fangs, things just go wrong!

319
00:22:49,239 --> 00:22:51,256
This is definitely Mokku's head!

320
00:22:51,590 --> 00:22:52,700
Time to bite it off!

321
00:22:54,060 --> 00:22:55,146
Ah! Hey, stop that!

322
00:22:57,094 --> 00:22:58,400
Who's over here?!

323
00:22:58,467 --> 00:22:59,318
Don't come near me!

324
00:22:59,779 --> 00:23:00,470
Here it comes... bam! Ah!

325
00:23:00,494 --> 00:23:01,370
Hey, stop it!

326
00:23:01,701 --> 00:23:03,701


327
00:23:05,046 --> 00:23:07,319
Open up! Get me out of here!

328
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:10,153
So someone was messing with me after all.

329
00:23:10,177 --> 00:23:11,600
Now I don't have to worry.

330
00:23:11,822 --> 00:23:15,130
Now then, I'll take my sweet time with you.

331
00:23:15,287 --> 00:23:18,509
This time I'll bite your head right off!

332
00:23:33,071 --> 00:23:38,114
<i>Redbeard the mouse plots with Kenken and
his gang to swindle Mokku out of his lunch.</i>

333
00:23:38,931 --> 00:23:41,353
<i>While chasing after them,
Mokku loses his footing...</i>

334
00:23:41,377 --> 00:23:44,400
<i>...and tumbles to the
bottom of a deep ravine.</i>

335
00:23:45,454 --> 00:23:49,640
<i>Spotting Mokku after he miraculously
survives, Redbeard and his gang
set fire to the shack.</i>

336
00:23:50,514 --> 00:23:54,240
<i>The raging flames spread
as if hunting Mokku down.</i>

337
00:23:55,424 --> 00:23:57,860
<i>Will Mokku be able to escape?</i>

338
00:23:58,459 --> 00:24:01,487
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku!</i>

